    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside the restaurant, supplier Timur surprises Chef Viktor by arriving as Elena's driver, and Max reflects on Cicero's idea of justice and how life works out in unexpected ways. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Эй, дорогой, присаживайся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Тимур, ты чего здесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Елена сказала отвезти тебя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Надеюсь, у тебя хорошая подружка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Справедливость — это воздаяние.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Так сказал Цицерон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но это фигня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Цицерон не жил сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Люди обманывают.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто-то несёт наказание за другого.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Жизнь сложная штука.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но в этом есть справедливость.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Эй, дорогой, присаживайся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, my friend, hop in.' Pulling up outside the restaurant, supplier Timur waves Viktor over and tells him to hop in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Тимур, ты чего здесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Timur, what are you doing here?' Expecting Elena, a surprised Barinov asks what Timur is doing here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Елена сказала отвезти тебя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Elena told me to drive you.' Timur explains that Elena asked him to chauffeur the injured chef on his 'errand'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Надеюсь, у тебя хорошая подружка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope you have a nice friend.' Guessing Viktor was hoping for a date, Timur jokes that he hopes Viktor has a nice girlfriend waiting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Справедливость — это воздаяние.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Justice is giving someone their due.' In the closing voiceover, Max quotes the definition of justice as giving each person their due.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Так сказал Цицерон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cicero said so.' He notes that the Roman philosopher Cicero said that centuries ago.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но это фигня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But that's nonsense.' Max shrugs that in real life, that lofty theory is nonsense.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Цицерон не жил сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cicero didn't live now.' After all, Cicero never lived in modern-day Moscow.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Люди обманывают.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'People lie.' People cut corners and deceive each other every day.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто-то несёт наказание за другого.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone gets punished for someone else.' Sometimes one person ends up paying the price for someone else's scheme.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Жизнь сложная штука.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Life is complicated.' Max concludes that life is a complicated thing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Но в этом есть справедливость.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But there is justice in that.' Yet somehow, in its own crooked way, justice still finds a way through. Now let us listen to the conversation once again.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
